{"sha256": "139f96454954a4b77b3f07a796946827c29a81754f9a782e3e25dd5dfc76e0d5", "embedder": "OllamaEmbeddings:nomic-embed-text:structured", "chunks": [{"id": "47fe17f7-86c2-4add-a343-3f630396749b", "text": "Amendment to the Seventh Schedule under section 3 of Telangana Motor Vehicles Taxation Act, 1963 (Act No.5 of 1963) - Notification - Preamble\nGOVRNMENT OF TELANGANA\nABSTRACT\nTransport Department – Motor Vehicles – Taxation – Amendment to the", "metadata": {"manifest_id": "go-ms-16-2026-trb", "parts": 1, "location": "goir/2026TRB_Ms16.pdf#page=1", "chapter": "", "provision_id": "Preamble", "page_start": 1, "jurisdiction": "Telangana", "title": "Amendment to the Seventh Schedule under section 3 of Telangana Motor Vehicles Taxation Act, 1963 (Act No.5 of 1963) - Notification", "manifest_notes": "Department G.O. copy dated 20-03-2026, from the GOIR register. Amends the Seventh Schedule as amended by G.O.Ms.No. 22/2022 and 53/2025 (removes the additional 2% tax on second or more personalised vehicles). The text states it comes into force with effect from 23-03-2026; effective_date left null pending legal review. Gazette print not obtained. Title, number, department and date were read from the document (09-11-2026); this is not legal verification. Scope checked against the PDF (09-11-2026): deletes column No. 8 of the Seventh Schedule and its entries (additional 2% on second or more personalized vehicles up to 10 seats owned by an individual, at registration of new vehicles only). Para 4: in force with effect from 23-03-2026.", "sha256": "139f96454954a4b77b3f07a796946827c29a81754f9a782e3e25dd5dfc76e0d5", "verification_status": "unverified", "split_method": "whole", "extraction_warning": "", "answer_eligible": true, "part": 1, "document_number": "G.O.Ms.No. 16", "has_table": false, "provision_kind": "Preamble", "state": "Telangana", "issuing_authority": "Transport, Roads & Buildings (Tr.I) Department, Government of Telangana", "document_type": "G.O.", "validity_status